        <mxCell id="leg_note1" value="Phase 1 runs in GitHub Actions.&#xa;Phase 2 + operator run in ECS Fargate (or local Docker).&#xa;S3 is the data bus between all stages.&#xa;Two SQS queues: phase1-notifications, sbom-tree-requests.&#xa;Two DynamoDB tables: SpdxIndexTable, SpdxDependencyGraph.&#xa;REST API on :8080 for artifact S3 lookups." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="legend">
